  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2386,
      "text": "when We inspired your mother, saying,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 314,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2387,
      "text": "‘Put him into the casket, then cast it into the river. The river will carry it to the shore, and he will be picked up by one who is an enemy to Me and enemy to him.’ I bestowed upon you love from Myself[9] so that you would be brought up under My [watchful] Eye.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 314,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2388,
      "text": "When your sister was going along and said, ‘Shall I show you someone who will nurse him?’ Thus We brought you back to your mother, so that she may rejoice and not grieve[10]. Then you killed a man [by mistake][11], but We saved you from distress, and We put you through several trials. You stayed among the people of Midian for several years, then you came [here] at a destined time, O Moses.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 314,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2389,
      "text": "I have chosen you for Myself.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 314,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2390,
      "text": "Go forth, you and your brother, with My signs, and do not slacken in remembering Me.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 314,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2391,
      "text": "Go, both of you, to Pharaoh, for he has certainly transgressed all bounds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 314,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2392,
      "text": "But speak to him gently, so that he may take heed or fear Allah.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 314,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2393,
      "text": "They said, “Our Lord, we fear that he may hasten to punish us or transgress all bounds.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 314,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2394,
      "text": "He said, “Do not be afraid; I am with you both, hearing and seeing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 314,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2395,
      "text": "So go to him and say, ‘We are both messengers from your Lord, so let the Children of Israel go with us and do not oppress them. We have come to you with a sign from your Lord, and peace[12] be upon he who follows the true guidance.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 314,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2396,
      "text": "It has been revealed to us that the punishment awaits those who reject [the truth] and turn away.’”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 314,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2397,
      "text": "Pharaoh said, “So who is the Lord of you two, O Moses?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 314,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2398,
      "text": "He said, “Our Lord is the One Who gave everything its form and then guided it.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 314,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2399,
      "text": "Pharaoh said, “Then what about the former [disbelieving] nations?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
